    "description": "The Hotel Loyalty Points Statement API allows users to retrieve detailed statements of their loyalty points accumulated with various hotel chains. This endpoint is designed for frequent travelers who wish to track their points and stay informed about their loyalty status. The API provides access to a user's loyalty points information, including point balance and transaction history. Typical consumers include hotel loyalty program members and travel management applications that facilitate customer engagement and analytics.",
